id: damage-inhibitor
name: Damage Inhibitor
order: 4
category: body
importance: secondary
description: >
  Durable and reinforced (often with metal), Androids can shrug off damage more easily than most.
text: >
  Damage Inhibitor (Body): Durable and reinforced (often with metal), Androids can shrug off damage more easily than most.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Damage Reduction by 2(T) and halve any Collision Damage you receive.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use the Direct Hit option of the Defend Maneuver, reduce the Damage Category of that Attacking Maneuver by 1 Category for the sake of your Damage calculation.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use the Direct Hit or Guard options of the Defend Maneuver, increase your Damage Reduction by 2(T) for the duration of that Maneuver.

---

# (1) Every Collision Damage taken halved, as Rubbery Body's (chat.mjs).
[passive]
damageReduction += 2(T);
allow collision.halved;

# (2) Direct Hit: the Category one lower for your Damage alone, where the hit is settled (chat.mjs). Automatic by default;
# set Triggered, ticked in Respond.
[triggered/direct-hit, 1/round, effect 2]
incoming.damage.category.shift -= 1;

# (3) Direct Hit or Guard: 2(T) more Damage Reduction against that attack, where its Damage is settled (chat.mjs).
# Automatic by default; set Triggered, ticked in Respond.
[triggered/guard-or-direct-hit, 1/round, effect 3]
damageReduction += 2(T);
